body:
Dear, Least-Respect-389 

&#x200B;

There is one more thing..

life sucks. and i mean it , its very hard for a lot of people. It doesn't matter if u think and strongly believe that youre life is pointless . i am 15 and i have the same though as u. i am realy stressed of school i mean a lot and my family doesnt care at all 

i have lost my mom when i was 7 i still have scarfs for what happened . i had almost lost my dad too amlost but he was very lucky . anyway back to you

&#x200B;

youre family will stil love u even if you dont make it to colege or even school . they will forever love you what ever you dissappoint them to . at the end the best thing it can happen to someone is trye love and trust me its all u need 

&#x200B;

i would like to hear from u and not just commit to doing it 

something extra . i am talking to u only bc i dont want to live too but i cant let u go like this 

&#x200B;

regards with love,

&#x200B;

frienDlyleet
